From 3027e420482b75f3b48e6c100fee4494fc9bbf31 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 23:13:33 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat(ui): sign language patient view, clip review page and
 research view

- Patient card in sign language: signing figure with captions, pause, replay
  and slower controls, the guide's reply after every answer (urgent replies
  as an alert), and a fallback to English when clips are not available.
- Label the How2Sign ASL clips on screen as research, not Kenyan Sign
  Language and not reviewed, and credit the dataset.
- Restyle /ksl with the design system and the real approval rules; add it
  to the navigation and a label for the ksl_reviewer role.
- Restyle /dev/ksl-research.
- Fix type errors in EnterFlow and a lint error in TelegramSim that failed
  the frontend checks on main.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017y9ojZA4KCduXjRUQqPekC
